{"1694600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD: Remake", "steam_appid": 1694600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join The Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/aefcfcc25bf33964ea0f0cf2d9f49b9e.avif?t=1784895759\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/7a6bce21a23b4b38fb8e6c87f3b6cc5c.avif?t=1784895759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras_big/7a6bce21a23b4b38fb8e6c87f3b6cc5c.avif?t=1784895759 width=1560 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/429e40700ec456e967bc13fbdd853212.avif?t=1784895759\" width=616 height=399 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nobody leaves here alive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD: Remake</strong> is a remade version of the game introduced in 1997 in arcade platform. A classic arcade rail-shooter receives a whole new entourage and gameplay changes to suit modern gaming standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/6c8b104a16b0d40b72e39ff70ed46cb7.webp?t=1784895759\" width=616 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/ce9932ef33ec6cd736af02c5b3897377.avif?t=1784895759\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Well known arcade classic with modern graphics and controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• True to the original gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Local 2-player multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Photomode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Armory with unlockable weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hordes of the undead monstrosities in a new game mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gallery with encountered enemies and bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/8dabbba07771ae79b5ca34ae7c7dc2f2.poster.avif?t=1784895759\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/8dabbba07771ae79b5ca34ae7c7dc2f2.webm?t=1784895759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/8dabbba07771ae79b5ca34ae7c7dc2f2.mp4?t=1784895759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras/7a6bce21a23b4b38fb8e6c87f3b6cc5c.avif?t=1784895759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694600/extras_big/7a6bce21a23b4b38fb8e6c87f3b6cc5c.avif?t=1784895759 width=1560 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_